  "name": "Centre Point Silom",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "1494080"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "Located in Bangkok (Bangkok City Centre), Centre Point Silom is within a 5-minute drive of Odeon Circle and ICONSIAM.  This hotel is 2.7 mi (4.3 km) from MBK Center and 2.8 mi (4.6 km) from Siam Center."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 214 air-conditioned rooms featuring refrigerators and microwaves. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming is available for your entertainment. Bathrooms feature separate bathtubs and showers, complimentary toiletries, and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Don\u0027t miss out on the many recreational opportunities, including an outdoor pool, a sauna, and a fitness center. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a hair salon."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EChao Praya River - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E ICONSIAM - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E King Power MahaNakhon - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Asiatique The Riverfront - 2.2 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Yaowarat Road - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Thaniya Plaza - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Odeon Circle - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Silom Complex Shopping Mall - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chulalongkorn University - 2.7 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lumphini Park - 2.8 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Samyan Mitrtown - 2.8 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chulalongkorn Hospital - 2.9 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E River City Shopping Complex - 3 km / 1.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chinatown - 3 km / 1.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Wongwian Yai Market - 3.1 km / 1.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDon Mueang Intl. Airport (DMK) - 31.2 km / 19.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK) - 37.1 km / 23 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Centre Point Silom is Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe name on the credit card used at check-in to pay for incidentals must be the primary name on the guestroom reservation\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EAdditional fees apply to children 4-11 years old for breakfast when sharing existing bedding.\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E   \u003Cli\u003EOne child 11 years old or younger stays free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-out is available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Satisfy your appetite for lunch or dinner at the hotel\u0027s restaurant, or stay in and take advantage of the room service (during limited hours). Continental breakfasts are available daily from 6 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
